## Why Asked
Tests understanding of resilience patterns and operational excellence in distributed systems, which is essential for maintaining production reliability.

## Key Concepts
- Health monitoring and failure detection mechanisms
- Automated recovery and self-repair processes
- Circuit breakers and retry patterns
- Redundancy and failover strategies

## Code Example
```
class SelfHealingService {
  async monitor() {
    if (!await this.healthCheck()) {
      await this.restart();
      await this.circuitBreaker.reset();
    }
  }
}
```

